  "body": "[The spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/semantics.html#the-link-element:critical-subresources-2) has:\r\n\r\n> Once the attempts to obtain the resource and its critical subresources are complete, the user agent must, if the loads were successful, queue a task to fire an event named load at the link element…\r\n\r\nand\r\n\r\n> The element must delay the load event of the element's node document until all the attempts to obtain the resource and its critical subresources are complete.\r\n\r\nIf the link element is the last thing delaying the load event, the spec does not seem to ensure that the task to dispatch the load event at the link element is queued before the task to dispatch the load event at the window object.",
